            The warranty conflict probably reflects different versions: Landice’s residential page gives
            lifetime parts, while the retailer’s five-year figures match the terms Landice publishes for the
            rehabilitation version. When we checked Landice’s warranty page for our brand guide in October
            2026, it also said residential labour cover depends on dealer installation. Get the terms for the
            exact version you are buying in writing.
          </p>
