          <p>
            The difference is $900 with the Pro Sports console and $1,000 with the Achieve, for two inches of
            width, five of length and 100 lb more capacity. Garage Gym Reviews notes that the L8’s step-up is
            about two inches higher than the L7’s, which matters if you need a low deck. Choose the L8 if you
            are over about six feet and run, if you weigh close to 400 lb, or if several people of different
